entire city! \n\nKey Features:\n\nImport any Unity Prefab or 3D model into the application via our Unity Plugin (custom MonoBehaviour scripts excluded)\n\nPlace 3D objects in your environment on world-scale augmented reality using Passthrough. \n\nExpanding built-in asset library. \n\nCuboid is a local, standalone application for Meta Quest 2 and Meta Quest Pro. It does not require an internet connection or creating an account.\n\nTranslate, rotate and scale objects using gizmos and intuitive scale bounds handles, from a distance!\n\nSelect, cut, copy, paste, duplicate and delete objects via a context menu.\n\nFull undo / redo support.\n\nSave and load scenes to and from a local .json file, name files.\n\nDraw primitive shapes and change corner radius or their color via a full RGB / HSV color picker.", "short_description": "Cuboid allows you to design for the real world, in the real world. Import high quality assets, and place and manipulate them at world-scale in your environment. Reimagine your living room, your house, or an entire city! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cuboid.readthedocs.io/en/latest/about/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://cuboid.readthedocs.io/en/latest/about/license/", "publisher_name": "ShapeReality", "support_website_url": "https://cuboid.readthedocs.io/en/latest/about/support/", "website_url": "https://shapereality.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCA